# File teks disimpan LF di repo, tapi di-checkout dengan akhir baris asli
# OS masing-masing. Di Windows otomatis jadi CRLF, di Linux/Mac tetap LF.
# Ini menghilangkan warning "LF will be replaced by CRLF".
* text=auto

# File biner — jangan diutak-atik line ending-nya.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.ttf binary
*.otf binary
*.pdf binary
